<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'About Us' }) %>

<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <%- include('../partials/header', { activePage: 'about' }) %>

    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="section hero"
            style="padding: 8rem 0; text-align: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);">
            <div class="container animate">
                <h1 style="font-size: 4rem;" class="mb-4">Our <span class="text-gradient">Story</span></h1>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 800px; margin-inline: auto; line-height: 1.8;"
                    class="mb-0">
                    EventHub was born out of a simple idea: that connecting people through shared experiences should be
                    effortless, inspiring, and beautiful. We're rebuilding the infrastructure of the event industry from
                    the ground up.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Mission & Vision -->
        <section class="section">
            <div class="container"
                style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: center;">
                <div class="animate stagger-1">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem;" class="mb-4">Redefining <span class="text-gradient">Gatherings</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;" class="mb-4">
                        Traditional event platforms are cluttered and complex. We believe in high-end aesthetics
                        combined with powerful, intuitive tools that empower both organizers and attendees.
                    </p>
                    <div style="display: grid; gap: 1.5rem;">
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem;">
                            <div
                                style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1); border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                                <i class="fa fa-bolt" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.5rem;"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Lightning Fast</h4>
                                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.95rem;">Seamless ticket booking and
                                    management in seconds.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem;">
                            <div
                                style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1); border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                                <i class="fa fa-shield-alt" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.5rem;"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Secure & Reliable</h4>
                                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.95rem;">End-to-end encryption for every
                                    transaction and user data.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="animate stagger-2"
                    style="height: 500px; background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540575861501-7ad0582371f3?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800') center/cover; border-radius: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Stats Section -->
        <section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-surface);">
            <div class="container">
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2rem; text-align: center;">
                    <div class="animate stagger-1">
                        <div style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                            500K+</div>
                        <div
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                            Tickets Sold</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="animate stagger-2">
                        <div style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                            2K+</div>
                        <div
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                            Organizers</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="animate stagger-3">
                        <div style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                            50+</div>
                        <div
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                            Cities</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="animate stagger-4">
                        <div style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                            4.9</div>
                        <div
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                            User Rating</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Section -->
        <section class="section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="card glass"
                    style="padding: 5rem; text-align: center; border-radius: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1), transparent);">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Ready to <span
                            class="text-gradient">Experience</span> More?</h2>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;">Join
                        thousands of people discovering incredible events every day.</p>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; justify-content: center;">
                        <a href="events" class="btn btn-primary"
                            style="padding: 1.2rem 3rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">Explore Events</a>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-outline"
                            style="padding: 1.2rem 3rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">Create Account</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-grid">
                <div>
                    <a href="/" class="logo" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">EVENT<span>HUB</span></a>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">The leading platform for managing and
                        discovering world-class events.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Quick Links</h4>
                    <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); display: grid; gap: 0.8rem;">
                        <li><a href="events">Browse Events</a></li>
                        <li><a href="about">Our Story</a></li>
                        <li><a href="contact">Contact Us</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Legal</h4>
                    <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); display: grid; gap: 0.8rem;">
                        <li><a href="../terms">Terms</a></li>
                        <li><a href="../privacy">Privacy</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Social</h4>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem;">
                        <a href="#" style="color: var(--text-dim);"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" style="color: var(--text-dim);"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" style="color: var(--text-dim);"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2026 EventHub Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <%- include('../partials/footer-scripts') %>
</body>

</html>